00:07:00.591 --> 00:07:04.624
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:07:05.223 --> 00:07:13.887
<v Slow>全国の平均の新しい最低賃金は、1時間でいくらですか。

00:07:14.687 --> 00:07:18.624
<v Host>One thousand one hundred seventy-six yen per hour.

00:07:19.223 --> 00:07:26.136
<v Slow>新しい最低賃金は、いつごろから始まりますか。

00:07:26.935 --> 00:07:29.072
<v Host>Around October this year.

00:07:29.672 --> 00:07:45.175
<v Host>That's all for today. Japan plans to raise its minimum wage by fifty-five yen, to a national average of one thousand one hundred seventy-six yen per hour, starting around October. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

00:07:45.776 --> 00:07:48.175
<v News>また明日。
